msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_unpublish.rst:45
msgid ""
"Set the type of a package to unpublish (if you have packages with the same "
"name). The default is set to the ``library``. See supported :ref:"
"`cmd_pkg_install_types`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../core/userguide/pkg/cmd_unpublish.rst:51
